  m_Name: Blind Faith
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: Blind Faith
  description: 'First-Person Horror Puzzle

    An atmospheric horror puzzle game
    set in a technologically corrupted Victorian era. The player wakes in a church
    repurposed as a sinister laboratory, using light manipulation to solve environmental
    puzzles and unravel the dark history of the place. Built as part of an ITU project,
    Blind Faith leans into atmosphere and environmental storytelling to create a
    slow-burning, unsettling experience.


    I contributed with production/pitch,
    all sound design and implementation(Wwise & C#)

    Voice acting, Unity Development
    and programming(C#)'
